## ✅ Post-Configuration Verification

Verify the Access Control List (ACL) directly from the command line:

```powershell
Get-Acl -Path "C:\CorpData\HR-Docs" | Format-List AccessToString
```
*Look for the specific department group and ensure generic `Users` are absent.*

