## 🚨 Common Pitfalls & Troubleshooting

* Error: A user is in the HR group but still gets "Access Denied."
  * Cause: The user was added to the Active Directory security group, but they haven't logged out of their computer yet.
  * Fix: Security tokens are generated at login. The user must log off and log back into Windows to receive their new group permissions.

